Pattern      : Bitmasking

Approach     : Generate all masks from 0 to 2^n-1

Time          : O(n * 2^n)
Space         : O(n * 2^n)

Status              : ⭐ Must Revise
Frequently Asked    : ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
